# SYNTHETIC — non-functional. Real .key / .pem private keys sit next to web
# server configs, in C:\certs, IIS export folders, and app bundles. An
# unencrypted "BEGIN RSA/EC/OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY" block is usable as-is; a
# "BEGIN ENCRYPTED PRIVATE KEY" block needs the passphrase.
